":ref:`MIX_TARGET_SURROUND<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer_constant_MIX_TARGET_SURROUND>`    "
"路由到所有扬声器位置，   :ref:`MIX_TARGET_CENTER<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer_constant_MIX_TARGET_CENTER>`"
